<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Zivnobanka posts CZK378 mln '96 net.</title>
<headline>Czech Zivnobanka posts CZK378 mln '96 net.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech bank Zivnobanka a.s. said on Monday it posted 1996 audited net profits, according to international accounting standards (IAS), of 378 million crowns versus 406 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
